{"id":1050103,"name":"이리나·심문 III","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"이리나·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1050103]}],"trial":{"trial_id":50103,"stage":"3단계","unlock_time":"2022-11-24 14:00:00","diary1":"사막 함선 위, 이리나는 자신이 화이트 샌드와 사막 함선에 대한 장악 능력을 보여주었다.\n　　하지만 생각지 못한체, 당신들은 화이트 샌드에서 습격자를 만나게 되었다.","diary2":"화이트 샌드에서 습격을 받은 소녀가, 성인이 되는 동시에 수감자로도 되었다.\n　　이리나는 당신에게 자신의 과거를 알려주었고 그녀의 결심도 밝혔다.\n　　이리나의 확인하에, 당신들을 습격한 사람이 그녀의 친아버지라는 것을 알게 되었다.\n　　이리나의 멘탈 붕괴에 맞서, 당신은 플레시·캠벨을 해결하기로 한다.","evidence":[{"ID":260173,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260174,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":3,"dialogue_id":150103016,"next":[17]},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":150103